[{"client_msg_id":"dbbe5aa2-226b-4d0a-a2c6-70801ed9d151","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"こうなった","ts":"1624673541.428200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"llerC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c8c55ac-fcdd-4a3f-8900-b9cb169bbb61","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/hashue/config/blob/master/shell/docker/docker.sh\u003e","ts":"1624673537.427900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/hashue/config/blob/master/shell/docker/docker.sh | docker.sh\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/hashue/config/blob/master/shell/docker/docker.sh | docker.sh\u003e","text":"```\nset -eu\n\nfunction comp-docker-image(){\n  docker run `docker images --format \"{{.Repository}}:{{.Tag}}\" | fzf`\n}\n\nfunction exec-docker-container(){\n  read -p \"command (press enter key to skip): \" CMD\n\n  if [[ -n \"${CMD}\" ]]; then\n      docker exec -it  `docker ps --format \"{{.Names}}\" | fzf` ${CMD}\n  else\n      docker exec -it  `docker ps --format \"{{.Names}}\" | fzf` bash\n  fi\n}\n\nfunction all-down-container(){\n  docker stop `docker ps -qa` \u0026amp;\u0026amp; docker rm `docker ps -qa`\n}\n\ncase $1 in\n  run  ) comp-docker-image ;;\n  exec ) exec-docker-container ;;\n  ald  ) all-down-container ;;\nesac\n\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/hashue/config|hashue/config\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rb+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee3a5e03-618c-4044-9676-a7c83937c1bd","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"今、雑にこんなスクリプトを書いている\n```set -eu\n\nfunction comp-docker-image(){\n  docker run `docker images --format \"{{.Repository}}:{{.Tag}}\" | fzf`\n}\n\nfunction exec-docker-container(){\n  docker exec -it  `docker ps --format \"{{.Names}}\" | fzf` bash\n}\n\nfunction all-down-container(){\n  docker stop `docker ps -qa` \u0026amp;\u0026amp; docker rm `docker ps -qa`\n}\n\ncase $1 in\n  run  ) comp-docker-image ;;\n  exec ) exec-docker-container ;;\n  ald  ) all-down-container ;;\nesac```","ts":"1624671766.427700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hyt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98005f3c-fd07-4e2f-8001-640d1b775dd0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"たしかに、関数のが良いかも","ts":"1624671635.426600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s7W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8bc1f31f-2c94-406c-ad75-19dfd144ae03","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/dotfiles/blob/b73d76674334eb254c58127f48b12c5cb6a68a2d/vim/sonictemplate/make/base-docker.mak#L1-L3\u003e\nmakefileにしちゃっているな","ts":"1624671622.426100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/dotfiles/blob/b73d76674334eb254c58127f48b12c5cb6a68a2d/vim/sonictemplate/make/base-docker.mak | base-docker.mak\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/dotfiles/blob/b73d76674334eb254c58127f48b12c5cb6a68a2d/vim/sonictemplate/make/base-docker.mak | base-docker.mak\u003e","text":"```\nselect_container=$$(docker ps -a | sed 1d | fzf | awk \"{print \\$$1}\")\nselect_image=$$(docker images | grep -v \"\u0026lt;none\u0026gt;\" | sed 1d | fzf | awk \"{print \\$$1}\")\nselect_running_container=$$(docker ps | sed 1d | fzf | awk \"{print \\$$1}\")\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/dotfiles|skanehira/dotfiles\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w1k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81eb4713-b3ba-491e-83ba-593e33773df3","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あと、はじめて自分でfzfを使った関数を定義してみたけど、fzf便利だな。\nこれで、だいぶdockerが便利になる\n```function comp-docker-image(){\n  BUFFER=$(docker images --format \"{{.Repository}}:{{.Tag}}\" | fzf)\n}```","ts":"1624670547.425900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mI1h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e29f307-394a-4de9-bde4-ee4fe7815256","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど","ts":"1624670500.424900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5kv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"326b1ab9-75a2-4db0-b862-f83a1839c5ce","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"確かにsubshellでsetはありですね","ts":"1624666494.423700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y4z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f37de0b-2108-439c-981e-3adb01252692","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ内部変数へ `${USER-}` して値を展開して、以降はそれを使うのがいいのかな?","ts":"1624664404.423000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aWe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3360a6a6-b066-4242-ab6f-fb3c826b2ea8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あとは、利用箇所の前後だけ `set +u` / `set -u` する(量がすくない+定義が明確)とか?","ts":"1624664358.422300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uk4=/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b01cdcd1-db91-499d-b299-64dfa9d5ceeb","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"一番パッと見わかりやすいのは、 `printenv`かなぁ","ts":"1624663584.421600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=10"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4eb4a485-3d17-4fed-91b4-1ea8b9fa013a","type":"message","user":"URNBMPJ4C","text":"`: \"${USER:=}\"` を冒頭に書いておく、とか。","ts":"1624663549.421100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4p/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"118c2ca5-7